    },
    "body": "**Problem:** Loading a UTXO snapshot on a pruned node can leave the active tip without block or undo data. Attempting a rollback with `dumptxoutset` then triggers an assertion and terminates the node.\n\n**Fix:** Reuse `GetPruneHeight` to reject rollback with the existing pruning error when the required data is unavailable.",
